{"3958200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FROB", "steam_appid": 3958200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/128796433e1d47aae90670309e0ef389.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1294 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/3dcaf6aa591c5c3c2ac278baf39af543.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In FROB, you play as a brave little frog on a mission. When a heron tadnaps his babies, he sets off in a daring chase, armed with nothing but his trusty bottle and scarf. He’ll get them home without a problem! FROBably..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/3ca0f59a3bb90afa6fe81f1930b27b8b.poster.avif?t=1779028808\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/3ca0f59a3bb90afa6fe81f1930b27b8b.webm?t=1779028808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/3ca0f59a3bb90afa6fe81f1930b27b8b.mp4?t=1779028808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/a0eb8ea32a0744f7a35d9af04e3522ae.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through urban streets and wild overgrowth as Frob the frog, navigating lush gardens, dense forest thickets, and old sewer tunnels. Find your way back to the familiar pond, fight the heron, and save your kids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/100ca46f59b7d9971a48ae2c50442b74.poster.avif?t=1779028808\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/100ca46f59b7d9971a48ae2c50442b74.webm?t=1779028808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/100ca46f59b7d9971a48ae2c50442b74.mp4?t=1779028808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/9ac1ce51c3973de769d0e740afb15707.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a frog tongue makes things a lot easier! Climb, swing, fight and jump your way to the finish line and over obstacles. But beware! Not every creature outside your lovely pond is a friend..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/e2b6ee3ed69c1b86904d852000d6de10.poster.avif?t=1779028808\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/e2b6ee3ed69c1b86904d852000d6de10.webm?t=1779028808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/e2b6ee3ed69c1b86904d852000d6de10.mp4?t=1779028808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/253227e4973bd70e2f7c9d25e05b3673.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each level, and pick up your tadpoles as you journey back home. Collect shiny jewel caterpillars and return them to a flashy moth — you might earn new colors and fresh accessories! Yay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/e31183ea2e596e92dfe4e4091a66d7ab.poster.avif?t=1779028808\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/e31183ea2e596e92dfe4e4091a66d7ab.webm?t=1779028808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/e31183ea2e596e92dfe4e4091a66d7ab.mp4?t=1779028808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/671a6e0bfea2bd640d51178002efc718.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started out as a semester project soon evolved into a passion project between four friends! FROBulous, right? :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/3f39cffc5620a71ccd0fceb2b1720903.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1560 height=569 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/128796433e1d47aae90670309e0ef389.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1294 height=134 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/128796433e1d47aae90670309e0ef389.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1294 height=134 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/3dcaf6aa591c5c3c2ac278baf39af543.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In FROB, you play as a brave little frog on a mission. When a heron tadnaps his babies, he sets off in a daring chase, armed with nothing but his trusty bottle and scarf. He’ll get them home without a problem! FROBably..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/3ca0f59a3bb90afa6fe81f1930b27b8b.poster.avif?t=1779028808\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/3ca0f59a3bb90afa6fe81f1930b27b8b.webm?t=1779028808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/3ca0f59a3bb90afa6fe81f1930b27b8b.mp4?t=1779028808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/a0eb8ea32a0744f7a35d9af04e3522ae.avif?t=1779028808\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through urban streets and wild overgrowth as Frob the frog, navigating lush gardens, dense forest thickets, and old sewer tunnels. Find your way back to the familiar pond, fight the heron, and save your kids!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958200/extras/100ca46f59b7d9971a48